# Repo-root .env, shared by the dev server and the Jellyfin container script.
#
# Where your Jellyfin server lives. Read by apps/web/vite.config.ts at
# dev-server startup and used as the /jf proxy target. Not exposed to the
# browser. In production the same role is played by JELLYFIN_UPSTREAM in
# services/web/compose.yaml.
JELLYFIN_URL=http://localhost:8096

# --- services/jellyfin/dev.sh (bun run dev:all) only ---------------------------------
# The always-there films folder on this machine. Mounted read-only at /media,
# which is what the "Movies" library points at.
LOCAL_MEDIA_PATH=$HOME/Movies
# The removable drive. Mounted at /mnt/toshiba when present, skipped when it is
# not -- that is what lets the stack come up with the drive unplugged. Must
# match the path the drive's library was configured with.
DRIVE_MEDIA_PATH=/Volumes/Untitled
# JELLYFIN_CONTAINER=jellyfin
# JELLYFIN_IMAGE=jellyfin/jellyfin:latest
# JELLYFIN_PORT=8096
